{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 83,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "83:1",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "Woe to those who give less [than due],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:2",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:3",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:4",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Do they not think that they will be resurrected",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:5",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "For a tremendous Day -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:6",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:7",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:8",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And what can make you know what is sijjeen?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:9",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:10",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "Woe, that Day, to the deniers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:11",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Who deny the Day of Recompense.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:12",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And none deny it except every sinful transgressor.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:13",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:14",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:15",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:16",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:17",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:18",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in ʿilliyyūn.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:19",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "And what can make you know what is ʿilliyyūn?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:20",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:21",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allāh].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:22",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:23",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "On adorned couches, observing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:24",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:25",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:26",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:27",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And its mixture is of Tasneem,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:28",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "A spring from which those near [to Allāh] drink.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:29",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:30",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:31",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:32",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:33",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "But they had not been sent as guardians over them.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:34",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:35",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "On adorned couches, observing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "83:36",
      "surahNumber": 83,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
